+Fixed ``tmpdir``, ``tmpdir_factory`` and ``tmp_path_factory`` failing to create the base temporary directory when the current user name contains characters which are not allowed in directory names, such as the domain separator returned by ``getpass.getuser()`` on Windows when connected through SSH.
